Third-Party Components
----------------------
Optional Z80 48-bit floating-point support via math48 (tools/math48.asm and
src/be_z80_math48.h) is NOT covered by this license. math48 is copyrighted by
Anders Hejlsberg (1980) and is subject to its own terms.

Optional 6502 32-bit floating-point support via wozfp (tools/wozfp.asm and
src/be_6502_wozfp.h) is NOT covered by this license. These routines were written
by R. Rankin and S. Wozniak and originally published in Dr. Dobb's Journal
(August 1976) without a copyright or license notice.
